	(text "OSD: AT7456E (MAX7456 compatible) on SPI2, supplied at 3.3V (spec 3.15-5.25V) so SPI levels match the MCU.\nCamera video: 75R termination + 100nF AC coupling into VIN. VOUT drives the VTX input (75R) directly; SAG tied to VOUT.\nR (DNP) = OSD bypass for debugging."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
